// ── mmo-mob-scaling PREVIEW row (Global tab, right column) ───────────────────
// Appended into #MmoscalingPreviewList (the five fixed samples), #MmoscalingProbeList (the one typed
// probe) and #MmoscalingLadderList (one rung per rarity tier, plain first) by
// cmd.append("<list>", "Pages/MmoscalingPreviewRow.ui"), then addressed per row via the INDEXED PARENT
// (e.g. "#MmoscalingPreviewList[0] #Line"), so the bare ids below are safe across many rows AND across
// mods (the ZigListRow rule). Two wrapping lines per row, both pushed on .TextSpans by
// MobScalingAdminPage (paintPreviewRow / ladderLine + detailLine), never re-appended for a repaint:
//   #Line   - the difficulty and the three stamped factors (health, hit, share of a hit taken), each
//             multiplier followed by the real number when the mod has one for the sample role
//             (mmomobscaling.ui.global.preview_row / ladder_row);
//   #Detail - the time to kill relative to an unscaled mob, plus an amber "rail holding" marker when a
//             ceiling decided the row (mmomobscaling.ui.global.preview_detail + preview_rail_*).
// No fixed height anywhere: a line that outgrows the 300px column wraps instead of truncating.

Group #MmoscalingPreviewRow {
  LayoutMode: Top;
  Anchor: (Bottom: 6);

  Label #Line {
    Text: "";
    Style: (FontSize: 12, TextColor: #cdd8e6, Wrap: true);
  }

  Label #Detail {
    Text: "";
    Style: (FontSize: 11, TextColor: #8fa3b8, Wrap: true);
  }
}
